{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HAB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"哈巴谷書","commonName":"哈巴谷書","title":"哈巴谷書","order":35,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"3950aea0497fecb9919bc35f98267a809e40b7449cd14053bf8d5ff0dbd8ea3b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":56},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是哈巴谷先知得到的啟示。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["哈巴谷的抱怨"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要向你呼救到何時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你才垂聽呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴虐橫行，我向你呼求到何時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你才肯拯救？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為何讓我目睹罪惡？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為何對邪惡坐視不理？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我眼前盡是毀滅和暴力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到處是紛爭和衝突。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此律法失效，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正義不彰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡人包圍義人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正義被扭曲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華的答覆"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「你們環顧列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仔細察看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必驚奇不已，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我要在你們的時代行一件事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使有人告訴你們，你們也不會相信。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使兇殘、暴虐的迦勒底人興起。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要席捲天下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"強佔別人的家園。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們任意妄為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"令人膽戰心驚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「他們的馬比豹子還快，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比夜間的豺狼還猛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的騎兵從遠方飛馳而來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如鷹撲食。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們殘暴成性，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像狂風一樣撲來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"抓獲的俘虜多如塵沙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們嘲笑君王，譏諷首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對一切堅城嗤之以鼻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修築高臺將其攻取。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些罪人如狂風橫掃而過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們奉自己的力量為神明。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["哈巴谷再次抱怨"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的上帝，我的聖者啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你從亙古就存在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你永不消逝","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你派迦勒底人來審判；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"磐石啊，你立他們作施罰者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的眼目極為清潔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"見不得邪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能容忍罪惡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你為何容忍奸惡之人呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡人吞滅比他們公義的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為何默然不語呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你為何使人像海裡的魚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像沒有首領的爬蟲呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦勒底人用鉤子鉤住他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用漁網網住他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用拖網把他們聚在一起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並因此而歡喜快樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦勒底人向漁網獻祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向漁網燒香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們靠漁網而富裕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"食物充足。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道他們要無休止地撒網，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無情地毀滅列國嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"「你永不消逝」另有希伯來文抄本作「我們不會死」。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NAM/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}